---
import aboutBg from '../assets/about-bg.jpg';
import { SITE, STATS } from '../data/site';

interface Props {
  showFull?: boolean;
}
const { showFull = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div class="relative">
        <img
          src={aboutBg.src}
          alt="Steve Kopshaw — founder of Metric Mentor Labs and creator of the Rev OS"
          class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover object-top"
          style="mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black 50%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black 50%, transparent 100%);"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-body text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-primary uppercase mb-3">About</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display text-foreground mb-2">
          Steve Kopshaw
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-accent mb-2">{SITE.founder.title}</p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm italic text-muted-foreground mb-6">
          {SITE.identityLine}
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Steve is the founder of Metric Mentor Labs and the creator of the
            <span class="font-accent text-xl text-primary">Rev OS</span> &mdash; the Revenue
            Playbooks Operating System. He has spent 20+ years on the floor of operating
            businesses, not in a boardroom or lecture hall. Operator pride, engineer training.
          </p>
          <p>
            He has operated 17 locations across 6 states, generated $300M+ in client and
            operator revenue, and was part of a $50M+ exit trajectory as COO and VP Growth
            at the Nutritional Coaching Institute (NCI).
            ClickFunnels Two Comma Club. Mentored through Acquisition.com.
            Computer engineering degree, Polytechnic University.
          </p>
          {showFull && (
            <>
              <p>
                The pattern across two decades is the same: founders at $500K–$25M with real
                revenue but no real freedom. The business still runs on them. It is not a
                hustle problem &mdash; they are already hustling. It is an infrastructure problem.
              </p>
              <p>
                Most consultants teach workshops about systems. MML installs them. The output
                of every engagement is documented playbooks, role scorecards, dashboards, and
                operating rhythms inside the client&rsquo;s business &mdash; not a slide deck.
              </p>
              <p>
                His roots are in health and fitness, but the work is industry-agnostic.
                Revenue leaks the same way whether you are selling supplements or SaaS.
                The diagnostics are the same. The fix paths are the same. What changes is
                the noun in front of "business."
              </p>
            </>
          )}
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-10">
          {STATS.map((stat) => (
            <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
              <div class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl gradient-text leading-none">{stat.number}</div>
              <div class="font-body text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">
                {stat.label}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        {!showFull && (
          <a href="/about" class="inline-block mt-8 font-body text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-accent hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Read Steve&rsquo;s full story &rarr;
          </a>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
